        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">The invulnerable save models in this unit receive from the Shield of Faith ability is improved by 1, to a maximum of 4+.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Rapturous Blows" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="042c-98ac-65a6-27c6">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">When resolving an attack made with a melee weapons by a model in this unit, you can re-roll the wound roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Armorium Cherub" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="7a24-5878-19ee-31aa">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">If this unit has an Armorium Cherub, then after a model in this unit shoots with a ranged weapon, that Armorium Cherub can reload that model&apos;s weapon. If it does, that Armorium Cherub is removed from play and that model can immediatly shoot with that ranged weapon again.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Rites of Fire" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="d444-ce08-04f4-051d">
